B.Le=s(["Leading architecture and development of a multi-role document workflow system spanning mobile (iOS/Android) and Flutter Web, using Clean Architecture, BLoC, GoRouter, and GetIt.","Engineered an offline-first caching architecture (Dio interceptor + Hive) with read/write request splitting and optimistic local execution, serving reads cache-first to cut redundant network calls.","Designed a cross-app duplicate-request prevention system (custom interceptor + BLoC-level guard) across 2 apps, eliminating duplicate-submission incidents caused by repeated taps and network retries.","Built a continuous PDF signing experience (pdfrx) with draggable signature-field placement across multi-page documents, resolving coordinate-accuracy, overlay-lifecycle, and cross-page gesture-crash issues, eliminating the crashes reported in the signing flow.","Designed deep linking and App/Web fallback strategies for seamless cross-platform sign-in and document-signing journeys.","Owned the release lifecycle for iDara Sign end-to-end \u2014 from code review through App Store and Google Play submission, managing privacy labels, OTP review requirements, and deep-link configuration \u2014 shipping both platforms through multiple review cycles."],t.s)
